omx-panel (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * version 0.5.0
  * systemd: a drop-in queues the GUI sync after each scan, replacing the
    WantedBy
  * modgui-gen: a descriptor with no control keeps its nothing-to-draw line
  * layout: a descriptor with no control to lay out is refused by code and
    says why
  * modgui: omx-panel modgui points the bundle manifest at modgui.ttl
  * layout: a CLAP control is keyed p<id>, so two parameters of one name are
    two controls
  * modgui: a trigger control is left off the face and named, the rest is
    drawn
  * modgui: a choice control with no values is refused by code

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 04:00:40 +0000
